.TH CBMAP_VISIT_ALL 3
.SH NAME
cbmap_visit_all \- traverse all elements in a map
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <cbmap.h>
.P
.BI "int cbmap_visit_all(cbmap_t " map ", cbmap_visitor " visitor_fn ", void* " user_data ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR cbmap_visit_all ()
iterates over every entry in the map and invokes
.I visitor_fn
with the key, value, and the provided
.I user_data
pointer.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success.